# Check a pull request

Read only.

## Plan: bfc-5v7x Payments via Stripe

- State: approved

### Acceptance criteria

- AC-1: An invalid card returns 402.
- AC-2: A successful payment sends one email,
  even when the webhook is delivered twice.

### Out of scope

Refunds and currencies other than EUR.

### plan.md

```markdown
## Context

Cards fail.

## Approach

Stripe.

## Affected areas

payments/

## Out of scope

Refunds and currencies other than EUR.

## Tasks

- T-1: Add the client.

## Acceptance criteria

- AC-1: An invalid card returns 402.
- AC-2: A successful payment sends one email,
  even when the webhook is delivered twice.
```

### Result

Give this JSON object on stdin to `bfc check record bfc-5v7x --pr <n> --head <head sha> --base <base sha>`. Give every criterion above once, each `met`, `not-met` or `cannot-verify`; `out_of_scope` is `[]` when there are none.

```json
{
  "criteria": {
    "AC-1": "<status>",
    "AC-2": "<status>"
  },
  "out_of_scope": ["<one sentence per out-of-scope change>"],
  "summary": "<the Markdown summary>"
}
```
